<title>JAPAN: Daiei says to brief media on buying Yaohan outlets.</title>
<headline>Daiei says to brief media on buying Yaohan outlets.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiei Inc said on Monday that it and Yaohan Japan would hold a news conference at 5 p.m. (0800 GMT) in Tokyo on its purchase of some of Yaohan&quot;s retail outlets.  </p>
<p>Yaohan Japan, the flagship firm of the Yaohan international retailing group, has been burdened with hefty borrowings after aggressive expansion.</p>
<p>Earlier this month the supermarket chain operator announced restructuring plans which included selling some of its stores in Japan.</p>
<p>The company has also sought assistance from banks to raise operating funds.</p>
</text>
